    <item>
      <title>OpenAI又被“偷家”了？！扩散模型“顶流”宋飏，从OpenAI跳槽Meta，小扎这次图啥？</title>
      <link>http://192.168.50.247:1313/insights/openaiopenaimeta-20250926114004983-0/</link>
      <pubDate>Fri, 26 Sep 2025 11:40:04 +0800</pubDate>
